# Hoverstone Pilgrim: "{2}: Put target card from a graveyard on the bottom of its owner's library." (CR 400.3). It is a 2/5 flier
# (cast on turn 1 off Black Lotus, Mox Pearl and Mox Sapphire). On turn 3 Bot1 pays {2} (the pool is empty after) to put Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# (cast at Bot1 on turn 2, so in Bot2's graveyard) on the bottom of Bot2's library, not Bot1's; on turn 5 it puts Bot1's own Bolt (cast on
# turn 3) on the bottom of Bot1's library. Mox Jet is left untapped in between, so the {2} is exactly what was paid.

